think Measured the roster instead of trusting the card's old count of about 111 unrostered. Roster paths in construction/standing-equipment.kyri against every tools/gen/chapter/ witness: 157 witnesses on disk, 154 rostered, 3 not. Re-measured the same way over every .rish and .sh under tools/gen/chapter/: 168 files, 9 unrostered, of which 6 are not witnesses (prin, sundial, itinerary, prin_ticker, dep_crawl, brush_parse_tame_density).
